      "message": "Could we defer conflicting adds instead of dropping them? If an analog config arrives while a GPIO valve exists, removing the GPIO valve later won’t recreate the analog valve without another add event. The reverse transition can lose a GPIO add too. Please retain the desired interface and reconcile after retirement",
